{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "686c4c475f680969cc3795e65ec98dbd497aef30c4943592071ea36d5406a859", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん！\nおはようございます、お待ちしてました♪", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n早安，我正在等你呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_intro_1001_p", "source_sha256": "bac300da9999084782f4b6a7846eec04f0376af2ed1cc89185163e093b6e8479", "ja": "おはようございます、青羽さん。\nもしかして、社長からの伝言ですか？", "zh": "早安，青羽小姐。\n是社长有事找我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_intro_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "e21a591bcd77686528e0a1678c4cf23feecc13833e532872c92b2fe3f201315b", "ja": "はい、そうなんです！\n……あれ？　誰かからもう聞いちゃいましたか？", "zh": "嗯，没有错！\n……奇怪？你已经听别人说了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_intro_1003_102mis", "source_sha256": "97eb11ae0507f55b5ed62f30a590aa7587f6dc919c4f11660ae1e3b3d6e52a89", "ja": "あうう……{$P$}さんに、\n一番にお知らせしたかったのに……。", "zh": "呜呜……原本想第一个通知\n{$P$}先生的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_intro_1004_p", "source_sha256": "2cc811a6f0d026f389cf940f09fc3537053b7ff9ebcccb9c8838a03f8274fef9", "ja": "い、いえ！　そんな気がしただけです。\nありがとうございます、事務所へ行ってきますね！", "zh": "没、没有！我只是有这种预感而已。\n谢谢你帮忙转达，我去事务所啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_intro_1005_102mis", "source_sha256": "af397ceba2248972aa46af6ee49c73c33d9cec4124bf95c6e5a33de4229e645a", "ja": "あっ、はい、お気をつけて！\nいってらっしゃーい♪", "zh": "啊，好的，路上小心！\n请慢走～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_intro_1006_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_intro_1007_p", "source_sha256": "0fcf77af3d19ed83d5c5f84b77eb85656a96e59de9a58d9363d6bab465f06ee6", "ja": "失礼しま……", "zh": "打扰……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_intro_1008_101kot", "source_sha256": "b26d683415d42b378d40e1091f097c799790e4cedb7681f676b534a2535e0c43", "ja": "きゃあああ！！！！", "zh": "呀啊啊啊啊！！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_intro_1009_p", "source_sha256": "78719f45aac3d8566479dbbdd9f583c4331cd2191f6988ae0b6aaf9e478d0a65", "ja": "今の声は……音無さん！？\nどうしました！？", "zh": "刚才的声音是……音无小姐！？\n发生什么事了吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_intro_1010_101kot", "source_sha256": "86728a8168429e03ef574c2c89009a20f776da141ffe196b4d537893ec768229", "ja": "そ、そそっ！\nそそそそそこに、ヘビがががが……！", "zh": "那、那那！\n那那那那那里、有蛇蛇蛇蛇蛇……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_intro_1011_p", "source_sha256": "acdca538e2de73a41121f14151ececb1f1cbe58787b7125f323740c910f61207", "ja": "ええっ、本当ですか！？\n響を呼ぶか、それとも……ん？", "zh": "咦？真的吗！？\n要叫响吗？还是……嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_intro_1012_p", "source_sha256": "23e9aa202dd5d9e73d94d107ad0f7f03f9fa0bb0117439d6dd544eb02d29b47c", "ja": "音無さん、大丈夫ですよ。\nこれは本物じゃなくて、ヘビのおもちゃです。ほら。", "zh": "音无小姐，没事啦。\n这只蛇不是真的，只是玩具而已，你看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_intro_1013_101kot", "source_sha256": "5e05db32e29f95367c97713b7124eb87b40ad79d52ef6f5045a2de9f61174006", "ja": "えっ！？\n……あ、あら？　本当ですね……。", "zh": "咦！？\n……奇、奇怪？真的是玩具……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_intro_1014_p", "source_sha256": "ef97c38da0d6ab2057ecaa051ed38b19d61ca299458b0c7d802b058f18638ba4", "ja": "亜美か真美あたりのイタズラだと思います。\nすみません。", "zh": "我猜是亚美或真美的恶作剧。\n真不好意思。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_intro_1015_101kot", "source_sha256": "d5827cbf7f200d8615800817bd4aede70b08e437e0ca81bd1eb7d76fa544ad0b", "ja": "い、いいえ！　本物じゃなくてよかったです。私こそ、\n騒いだりしてすみません。うう、恥ずかしい……。", "zh": "别、别这么说！还好不是真的。我才要道歉，\n不好意思吓到你了。呜呜，真丢人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_intro_1016_president", "source_sha256": "cf68494d171449fb7ba4df395948bd05414f583352f78ab067089f1ae9d5bfe4", "ja": "はっはっは。\nたまには大声を出すのもいいものだよ。", "zh": "哈哈哈。\n偶尔大叫一下也是不错的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_intro_1017_p", "source_sha256": "b95a5107b769692de4c2dafb7c753178f050e16ed6e06c61b80b0810a81bb08b", "ja": "あっ、社長！　お疲れさまです。", "zh": "啊，社长！您辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_intro_1018_president", "source_sha256": "2dfa55f16ac0d716786e361d8bb7012ea69eef2c08f196c13055d667873ddc76", "ja": "君、よく来てくれたね！\n早速だが、相談したいことがある。", "zh": "你来了啊！\n事不宜迟，我想找你商量一件事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_intro_1019_president", "source_sha256": "42fe604ece43ba5c0e347c5f87d84ad58f299301942106bc3a72c5a41a644793", "ja": "オープン以来、これまで様々なユニットを\n送り出してきた我が765プロライブ劇場だが……。", "zh": "自开幕以来，我们765艺能演唱会剧场\n催生了各式各样的团体……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_intro_1020_president", "source_sha256": "fe087b0ad08a98580d612496ab0d310b55853ce8602e627393171071b160053a", "ja": "是非今回も、君の手で、\n劇場に新たな風を起こしてくれたまえ！", "zh": "希望这次也能借助你的力量，\n为剧场掀起崭新的风潮！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_intro_1021_p", "source_sha256": "236b3c7015aa38cfc005c4e026959648eb4f58ab54214f7812daaefb0489ac69", "ja": "新たな風、ですか……！", "zh": "您是说，崭新的风潮吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_intro_1022_president", "source_sha256": "3058847a65a714e1e1ca445423ba89761332f17fbe0558466a47ae57d6d9a053", "ja": "うむ。今回はテーマ以外、メンバー選びも歌も、\nすべて君に委ねたいと思っている。", "zh": "没错。这次除了主题之外，\n成员和歌曲的安排我都想交给你全权负责。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_intro_1023_president", "source_sha256": "93d9608028ccf93fdb8ca19d17ab6d976aa75b9b8221ef7c5b89f0ce31c28749", "ja": "テーマなんだが……風繋がりで、\n『爽やかな春の風』なんてどうかね？", "zh": "关于主题……呼应风潮，\n取作『爽朗春风』怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_intro_1024_101kot", "source_sha256": "0e31d9d09d457b71c0f80a960595786052acd90444bd6eec5cbaf22bcd153461", "ja": "爽やかな春の風……ステキですね！\nまだまだ寒いですから、春が待ち遠しいですし。", "zh": "爽朗春风……听起来真棒！\n现在天气还很冷，大家也都希望春天能快点来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_intro_1025_president", "source_sha256": "3e24654775c5588d73a6428492acc5755bdabafc8eef8baede7df4c54720b4bf", "ja": "うむ。寒さを吹き飛ばすほどホットな公演、\n期待しているよ！", "zh": "嗯，我很期待你办出一场\n可以赶跑冬寒的火热公演喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_intro_1026", "source_sha256": "1328858b72076382b4434a1d60241e572fa393e0e21d8022ddd6bd6bcd0ca477", "ja": "任せてください！", "zh": "请交给我吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_intro_2000_p", "source_sha256": "0c95459defeab2a6a82957cf29d7dbe1526d8517821210354153a9e4a1c3000b", "ja": "任せてください！\n劇場に、爽やかな風を吹かせてみせます！", "zh": "交给我吧！\n我一定会让剧场吹起一阵爽朗春风！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_intro_2001_president", "source_sha256": "b4af1e2edd8cd1207c201130164c9402fd080d4346221383be8d7de52c38567c", "ja": "うむ、いい返事だ！\nそれじゃあ君、よろしく頼んだよ！", "zh": "嗯，很棒的回答！\n那么，这事就交给你啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_intro_2002_101kot", "source_sha256": "144b2592b950d7a2c1099f2b43883e28f3c96fb95e39e5714b3bbe8a4565142e", "ja": "頑張ってください、{$P$}さん！\n私も、楽しみにしてますね♪", "zh": "要加油喔，{$P$}先生！\n我也很期待呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_intro_2003_p", "source_sha256": "897d254fed460a609967743e1833235486b63425706b0da55785f013b34c054d", "ja": "（ユニットのテーマは、爽やかな春の風か！\nさて、どんな組み合わせがいいだろう……）", "zh": "（团体的主题是爽朗春风啊！\n好，我该找怎样的组合呢……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
